add(71,'N=B×T와프레네공식T_s=κN,B_s=−τN으로N_s=−κT+τB를증명하라.','Use N=B×T, T_s=κN and B_s=−τN to prove N_s=−κT+τB.',[m(r'N_s=B_s\times T+B\times T_s=(-\tau N)\times T+B\times(\kappa N)'),m(r'N\times T=-B,\quad B\times N=-T')],[m(r'N_s=B_s\times T+B\times T_s=(-\tau N)\times T+B\times(\kappa N)'),m(r'N\times T=-B,\quad B\times N=-T')],m(r'N_s=-\kappa T+\tau B'))
add(72,'프레네–세레공식으로(a)r″의T,N전개,(b)r′×r″,(c)r‴의T,N,B전개,(d)비틀림의삼중곱공식을증명하라.','Using the Frenet–Serret formulas, derive(a)r″ in T,N;(b)r′×r″;(c)r‴ in T,N,B;(d)the scalar triple-product formula for torsion.',[m(r'v=s^{\prime}>0,\quad r^{\prime}=vT,\quad T^{\prime}=v\kappa N,\quad N^{\prime}=v(-\kappa T+\tau B)'),m(r'(a)\quad r^{\prime\prime}=v^{\prime}T+\kappa v^2N'),m(r'(b)\quad r^{\prime}\times r^{\prime\prime}=\kappa v^3B'),m(r'(c)\quad r^{\prime\prime\prime}=(v^{\prime\prime}-\kappa^2v^3)T+(3\kappa vv^{\prime}+\kappa^{\prime}v^2)N+\kappa\tau v^3B'),'(c)는(a)를t로미분하고위의T′,N′를대입해성분별로모은것이다.',m(r'(d)\quad(r^{\prime}\times r^{\prime\prime})\cdot r^{\prime\prime\prime}=\kappa^2\tau v^6,\quad|r^{\prime}\times r^{\prime\prime}|^2=\kappa^2v^6')],[m(r'v=s^{\prime}>0,\quad r^{\prime}=vT,\quad T^{\prime}=v\kappa N,\quad N^{\prime}=v(-\kappa T+\tau B)'),m(r'(a)\quad r^{\prime\prime}=v^{\prime}T+\kappa v^2N'),m(r'(b)\quad r^{\prime}\times r^{\prime\prime}=\kappa v^3B'),m(r'(c)\quad r^{\prime\prime\prime}=(v^{\prime\prime}-\kappa^2v^3)T+(3\kappa vv^{\prime}+\kappa^{\prime}v^2)N+\kappa\tau v^3B'),'(c)follows by differentiating(a)with respect to t, substituting T′,N′ and collecting components.',m(r'(d)\quad(r^{\prime}\times r^{\prime\prime})\cdot r^{\prime\prime\prime}=\kappa^2\tau v^6,\quad|r^{\prime}\times r^{\prime\prime}|^2=\kappa^2v^6')],m(r'\tau=\frac{(r^{\prime}\times r^{\prime\prime})\cdot r^{\prime\prime\prime}}{|r^{\prime}\times r^{\prime\prime}|^2}')+'; 위(a)–(c), v=s′. ',m(r'\tau=\frac{(r^{\prime}\times r^{\prime\prime})\cdot r^{\prime\prime\prime}}{|r^{\prime}\times r^{\prime\prime}|^2}')+'; (a)–(c)above, with v=s′.',parts=list('abcd'))
add(73,'a,b>0인나선r(t)=(a cos t,a sin t,bt)의곡률과비틀림이상수임을보여라.','Show that r(t)=(a cos t,a sin t,bt),a,b>0, has constant curvature and torsion.',[m(r'|r^{\prime}|=\sqrt{a^2+b^2},\quad r^{\prime}\times r^{\prime\prime}=\langle ab\sin t,-ab\cos t,a^2\rangle'),m(r'|r^{\prime}\times r^{\prime\prime}|=a\sqrt{a^2+b^2},\quad(r^{\prime}\times r^{\prime\prime})\cdot r^{\prime\prime\prime}=a^2b')],[m(r'|r^{\prime}|=\sqrt{a^2+b^2},\quad r^{\prime}\times r^{\prime\prime}=\langle ab\sin t,-ab\cos t,a^2\rangle'),m(r'|r^{\prime}\times r^{\prime\prime}|=a\sqrt{a^2+b^2},\quad(r^{\prime}\times r^{\prime\prime})\cdot r^{\prime\prime\prime}=a^2b')],m(r'\kappa=a/(a^2+b^2),\quad\tau=b/(a^2+b^2)'))
add(74,'(sinh t,cosh t,t)의(0,1,0)에서곡률과비틀림을구하라.','Find curvature and torsion of(sinh t,cosh t,t)at(0,1,0).',[m(r't=0,\quad r^{\prime}=\langle1,0,1\rangle,\quad r^{\prime\prime}=\langle0,1,0\rangle,\quad r^{\prime\prime\prime}=\langle1,0,0\rangle'),m(r'r^{\prime}\times r^{\prime\prime}=\langle-1,0,1\rangle'),m(r'\kappa=\sqrt2/(\sqrt2)^3,\quad\tau=-1/2')],[m(r't=0,\quad r^{\prime}=\langle1,0,1\rangle,\quad r^{\prime\prime}=\langle0,1,0\rangle,\quad r^{\prime\prime\prime}=\langle1,0,0\rangle'),m(r'r^{\prime}\times r^{\prime\prime}=\langle-1,0,1\rangle'),m(r'\kappa=\sqrt2/(\sqrt2)^3,\quad\tau=-1/2')],m(r'\kappa=1/2,\quad\tau=-1/2'))
add(75,'곡률중심의자취를축폐선(evolute)이라한다. (a)r_e=r+N/κ를설명하고(b)나선(cos t,sin t,t),(c)포물선y=x²의축폐선을구하라.','An evolute is the locus of centers of curvature. (a)Explain r_e=r+N/κ;(b)find it for(cos t,sin t,t);(c)find it for y=x².',['(a)접촉원중심은곡선의점에서주법선N방향으로반지름R=1/κ만큼이동한점이다. κ≠0에서정의된다.',m(r'(b)\quad\kappa=1/2,\quad N=\langle-\cos t,-\sin t,0\rangle'),m(r'(c)\quad r=\langle t,t^2\rangle,\quad\kappa=2/(1+4t^2)^{3/2},\quad N=\langle-2t,1\rangle/\sqrt{1+4t^2}')],['(a)The osculating-circle center lies a radius R=1/κ from the curve point in the principal-normal direction N, where κ≠0.',m(r'(b)\quad\kappa=1/2,\quad N=\langle-\cos t,-\sin t,0\rangle'),m(r'(c)\quad r=\langle t,t^2\rangle,\quad\kappa=2/(1+4t^2)^{3/2},\quad N=\langle-2t,1\rangle/\sqrt{1+4t^2}')],m(r'(b)\ r_e=\langle-\cos t,-\sin t,t\rangle;\quad(c)\ r_e=\langle-4t^3,3t^2+1/2\rangle'),parts=list('abc'))
add(76,'평면곡선에대해(a)ax(t)+by(t)+cz(t)=d라는상수관계와의동치를보이고(b)B가평면에수직,(c)τ=0임을보여라. (d)r(t)=(t,2t,t²)의평면과B를구하라.','For planar curves, (a)prove equivalence with a constant relation ax(t)+by(t)+cz(t)=d;(b)show B is normal to the plane;(c)show τ=0. (d)Find the plane and B for(t,2t,t²).',['(a)평면은0이아닌법선(a,b,c)과상수d로정의된다. 역으로이관계를만족하면그평면에놓인다. 계수a,b,c,d가모두0이아니고관계가성립한다면(a,b,c)도0일수없다.','(b)관계를두번미분하면법선은r′,r″에모두수직이다. r′×r″≠0인곳에서B는이법선의단위벡터±방향이다.','(c)연결된정칙구간에서κ≠0이면연속인B의부호가변하지않으므로B_s=0,따라서τ=−B_s·N=0이다.',m(r'(d)\quad2x-y=0,\quad r^{\prime}\times r^{\prime\prime}=\langle4,-2,0\rangle')],['(a)A plane is specified by a nonzero normal(a,b,c)and a constant d. Conversely, the relation puts the curve in that plane. If a,b,c,d are not all zero and the relation holds, (a,b,c)cannot be zero.','(b)Differentiate twice: the normal is perpendicular to r′ and r″. Where r′×r″≠0, B is one of the two unit-normal directions.','(c)On a connected regular interval with κ≠0, continuity prevents the sign of B from changing. Thus B_s=0 and τ=−B_s·N=0.',m(r'(d)\quad2x-y=0,\quad r^{\prime}\times r^{\prime\prime}=\langle4,-2,0\rangle')],m(r'(d)\quad B=\langle2,-1,0\rangle/\sqrt5,\quad2x-y=0')+'; τ=0은프레네벡터가정의되는곳에서성립한다.',m(r'(d)\quad B=\langle2,-1,0\rangle/\sqrt5,\quad2x-y=0')+'; τ=0 wherever the Frenet frame is defined.',parts=list('abcd'))
L=2.9e8*( (20*float(s.pi))**2+34**2)**.5
add(77,'DNA각나선의반지름은약10Å,한회전의상승량은34Å,회전수는2.9×10⁸이다. 각나선의길이를추정하라(1Å=10⁻⁸cm).','Each DNA helix has radius about10Å, rise34Å per turn and2.9×10⁸ turns. Estimate each helix’s length(1Å=10⁻⁸cm).',[m(r'r(t)=\langle10\cos t,10\sin t,\tfrac{34}{2\pi}t\rangle'),m(r'L_{turn}=\sqrt{(20\pi)^2+34^2}\ \text{Å}'),m(r'L=(2.9\times10^8)\sqrt{(20\pi)^2+34^2}\ \text{Å}'),'1Å=10⁻¹⁰m로환산한다. 두가닥을합한길이가아닌각가닥의길이이다.'],[m(r'r(t)=\langle10\cos t,10\sin t,\tfrac{34}{2\pi}t\rangle'),m(r'L_{turn}=\sqrt{(20\pi)^2+34^2}\ \text{Å}'),m(r'L=(2.9\times10^8)\sqrt{(20\pi)^2+34^2}\ \text{Å}'),'Convert with1Å=10⁻¹⁰m. This is the length of each strand, not the sum of both.'],m(rf'L\approx{L/1e10:.3f}\times10^{{10}}\ \text{{Å}}\approx{L*1e-10:.2f}\ \mathrm{{m}}'))
